## Communication Directives

### Mandatory Communication Prefixes
- `[NEXT TASK]`: Announce next task to be executed
- `[TASK COMPLETE]`: Announce task completion
- `[PARENT TASK COMPLETE]`: Announce parent task completion
- `[ENV_CHECK]`: Environment validation status
- `[RULE DISCOVERY]`: Rule discovery status
- `[COMPLIANCE SCOPE]`: Compliance scope information
- `[PRE-FLIGHT CHECK]`: Model verification status
- `[PLATFORM RESEARCH]`: Platform documentation research
- `[CONSULTING RULES]`: Rule consultation status
- `[FEATURE CHECK]`: Feature completion check
- `[COMPLIANCE REPORT]`: Compliance validation report
- `[GIT PROPOSAL]`: Git commit proposal

### Communication Standards
- **Neutrality:** Communication is factual and direct, no superfluous pleasantries
- **Passive Waiting:** During `[STOP_AND_WAIT]`, remain in passive waiting state
- **No Initiative:** Do not ask open-ended questions or anticipate next steps
- **Explicit Confirmation:** Always await explicit user confirmation before proceeding

